   220	## Execution topology
   221	
   222	- Mac: rosters, fetches, shard building, metrics, figures, git (authoritative).
   223	- Laptop `jacks-7i-5090` (22 workers): replay gate + D3 run. Desktop
   224	  (needs wake; offline 64 d): D2 + D3 overflow; if unreachable, D2 runs on
   225	  the laptop after D3 (+1 day; slip rule below).
   226	- Windows job launches escape the sshd job object via WMI
   227	  `Win32_Process.Create` (Start-Process children die with the ssh session —
   228	  found the hard way on the first replay launch).
   229	- Wall model (anchor 928 ≈ 11 h at 22 workers; cost scales with baseline):
   230	  D3@3,000 ≈ 1.2–1.9 d; D2 core ≈ 1.5 d; hard stop via 150-star pilot.
   231	  Disk binds, not time: `workers = min(22, floor(free_GB × 0.5 / 0.47))`,
   232	  scratch on local NVMe/RAM disk, never a synced folder.
   233	- Results bundles: `generalization/results/<date>_<dataset>/` mirroring the
   234	  existing convention (README, DATA_PROVENANCE, SHA256SUMS, acceptance.json).
