generalization/reviews/G2r4/sol_referee4.err:16:Round-4 FREEZE CHECK. Your round-3 verdict: generalization/reviews/G2r3/sol_referee3.md; dispositions: generalization/reviews/G2r3/RESPONSE.md. Verify your 5 minimal blockers and 6 new-contradiction items against the CURRENT generalization/GENERALIZATION_PLAN.md and generalization/METRICS_SPEC.md. One line per item: RESOLVED/UNRESOLVED + evidence line. Then the single question that matters: is the design FREEZABLE FOR EXECUTION now? If not, list ONLY execution-blocking items (no style points).
generalization/reviews/G2r4/sol_referee4.err:56:- **13 RESOLVED**
